Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Dimineața învăluită în ceață îmi arată o umbră necunoscută
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.00,0:00:08.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Lângă mine
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.00,0:00:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Distortion of a place in full bloom
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.00,0:00:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The streched out hand writhes and wavers in with the ticks of time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:17.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Vrei doar să mă rănești? Îți place să mă privești și să-mi desenezi sentimentele?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Unde este adevărul? Unde îl ții ascuns? Fără niciun fel de regret
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:23.00,Default,,0,0,0,,In the sky where the wind rushes by
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.00,0:00:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Glimmer! The voice that woke me up declared loudly
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Believe myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.00,0:00:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You have a wish you cannot give up on
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Nu uita!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.00,0:00:41.00,Default,,0,0,0,,So set loose your one and only impetus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.00,0:00:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep my faith!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.00,0:00:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,To that overprotected smile
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.00,0:00:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Realize!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.00,0:00:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry and shout, that incarnation of weakness that showed its face
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:56.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Unreavel it with all you've got
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.00,0:00:59.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Brand new world
